    "chunk_size_bytes": 1719,
    "chunk_text": "Norfolk Foods introduces Crumbs by Crescent at Culinary Art Food Expo 2025\n\nNorfolk Foods (Pvt) Ltd, a pioneer in the Sri Lankan frozen food industry, has expanded its product portfolio with the introduction of Crumbs by Crescent, a frozen bakery solution designed to bring restaurant-quality taste and convenience to both households and professional kitchens.\n\nFirst unveiled at the Culinary Art Food Expo 2025, Crumbs by Crescent has since become a significant step in Norfolk Foods\u2019 ongoing mission to innovate and respond to the changing needs of Sri Lankan consumers. The range covers an extensive selection of pizzas, pastries, buns, pies, muffins, and other savoury and sweet treats, all crafted with high-quality ingredients and designed to deliver oven-fresh flavour in minutes.\n\nThe Culinary Art Food Expo served as a launchpad for the brand, where chefs from leading star-class hotels sampled the products and offered positive feedback. Many highlighted how the range could seamlessly complement hotel buffets, high teas, and \u00e0 la carte menus, while also serving as a convenient, ready-to-bake option for restaurants and caterers.\n\nSpeaking on the launch, Ms. Ameena Ziauddin, President of Norfolk Foods, said, \u201cCrumbs by Crescent marks a new chapter for Norfolk Foods as we expand beyond our established vegetarian, meat, and poultry-based portfolio to offer bakery solutions for both homes and hospitality.\u201d\n\n\u2018The producer behind your favorite hits is back and this time, he\u2019s here for the underdogs\u2019\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
