    "description": "How to beat the NPP In 2029: BluePrints and Bloc parties",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/How-to-beat-the-NPP-In-2029-BluePrints-and-Bloc-parties/4-784924",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
