    "description": "NPP Govt. shows its inability to handle disaster situation properly \u2013 S.M. Marikkar",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/NPP-Govt-shows-its-inability-to-handle-disaster-situation-properly-S-M-Marikkar/56-784956",
    "lang": "en",
