    "language": "en",
    "md5": "19d7ff310996a6a1e928c1ff642cd5fd",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1742,
    "chunk_text": "Sri Lankan pride, global glory: Solar Booze sweeps service and performance excellence awards\n\nSolar Booze Ltd has emerged as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most recognised renewable energy companies in 2025, celebrating two prestigious awards on both international and national platforms. At the FusionSolar 4th Global Installer Summit 2025, held in Dongguan, China, the company was honored with the Excellent Performance Award, while on home soil it received the Service Excellence Award for Customer-Centric Renewable Solutions at the Clean Energy Awards 2025.\n\nCommenting on the achievement, Solar Booze Managing Director Nadika Herath said: \u201cThis achievement reflects the hard work of our dedicated team and the trust placed in us by our clients. It also reaffirms our vision of positioning Sri Lanka as a leader in renewable energy innovation.\u201d\n\nThe success was not only about recognition but also about responsibility. As Solar Booze continues to grow, the company emphasised its role in inspiring both industry peers and local communities to adopt sustainable practices and accelerate the transition toward renewable energy solutions with the world\u2019s number one products\n\nMarketing and Sales Consultant Peshala Wijewardhana said: \u201cThese awards strengthen our commitment to shaping a cleaner and smarter energy future for Sri Lanka. We see this as a reaffirmation of our ongoing efforts. We are already committed to these initiatives, and this serves as confirmation from all these bodies regarding our efforts\u2019\n\nLooking ahead, Solar Booze is set to expand its partnerships and introduce more advanced, technology-driven energy solutions, reaffirming its pledge to create a brighter, greener and smarter future for Sri Lanka and beyond."
  },
