    "chunk_text": "Revello chocolates enter Bahrain\n\nSri Lanka Embassy facilitates CBL brand\u2019s entry into the Kingdom\n\nSays Sri Lanka-Bahrain trade strengthens, enhances visibility of Sri Lankan products\n\nThe Embassy of Sri Lanka in Bahrain yesterday said it has successfully facilitated the first ever introduction of Revello chocolates to the Bahraini market.\n\n\u201cThis signals a significant step in strengthening commercial ties and paving the way for greater market access for Sri Lankan products,\u201d it said in a statement.\n\nRevello is a flagship product of CBL Foods International Ltd., one of Sri Lanka\u2019s largest food manufacturing conglomerates with a strong global presence across chocolates, biscuits, confectionery and nutritious food.\n\nThe first consignment of Revello chocolates will be available from early December through the Lulu Hypermarket chain, one of Bahrain\u2019s leading retail chains.\n\n\u201cThis milestone enhances the visibility of new Sri Lankan products within mainstream Middle Eastern retail channels,\u201d the Embassy said."
