    "chunk_size_bytes": 1981,
    "chunk_text": "HSBC recognised as Sri Lanka\u2019s Best Transaction Bank for 2025 by Euromoney\n\nHSBC has been awarded as the Best Transaction Bank in Sri Lanka, at the first-ever Euromoney Transaction Banking Awards for Excellence 2025. This recognition reflects HSBC\u2019s commitment to partner with Corporate & Institutional Banking clients in Sri Lanka to support their international trade and cash management needs. The award is also a powerful endorsement of the Bank\u2019s strategy, underscoring the importance of the role it plays in opening up a world of opportunity for its clients, effectively using HSBC Group\u2019s network, expertise, products and global channel capabilities.\n\nCommenting on the achievement, Mark Surgenor CEO of HSBC Sri Lanka stated, \u201cThis win, which is a first in Sri Lanka, is a tribute to the dedication of everyone in our Global Payments Solutions and Global Trade Solutions and Client Service teams in Sri Lanka and our valued clients for their continued trust and partnership. While this is a global accolade, its true meaning is local. It reinforces our continuing commitment to investing in Sri Lanka as we have done so throughout our longstanding presence, supporting businesses, and contributing to the journey towards greater economic prosperity.\u201d\n\nHSBC Sri Lanka was also recognised earlier this year as the Best International Bank in Sri Lanka by Euromoney and by Finance Asia magazines. Clients have voted HSBC the #1 Cash Management Provider in Sri Lanka in Euromoney Corporate Cash Management Survey 2025, Best Service Provider for Cash Management in Sri Lanka at The Asset Triple A Treasurise Awards 2025 and #1 Trade Finance Bank in Sri Lanka in Euromoney Trade Finance Survey 2025.\n\nApparel exports sustain momentum with 6% growth in first ten months of 2025\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browse