    "md5": "18c9d17955742bb4dc4e0bd34bcb8ef2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1849,
    "chunk_text": "Roar AdX shines at Meta Reels Awards\n\nThe Roar AdX team with Meta representatives at Meta Reels Impact event in Singapore\n\nElevates local brands to APAC spotlight with three wins and 10 finalists\n\nRoar AdX, the Meta Managed Advertising Partner and a subsidiary of Roar Global, played a central role in elevating Sri Lankan brands to regional visibility at the 2025 Meta Reels Impact Awards held recently in Singapore. This year\u2019s event marked the first time Sri Lankan brands participated as nominees, creating new opportunities for local marketers to benchmark their work against global brands and regional standards.\n\nThrough its long-standing partnership with Meta, Roar AdX facilitated Sri Lankan campaign submissions that demonstrated strong creative performance and measurable business impact. As a result, Spa Ceylon Ayurveda and Keells Supermarkets were recognised across multiple award categories, marking a significant milestone for the Sri Lankan digital marketing industry.\n\nSpa Ceylon Ayurveda \u2013 Best Reels for Brand and Best Reels for Community\n\nKeells Supermarkets \u2013 Best Use of Innovation and Generative AI\n\nIn addition, 10 further entries submitted by Roar AdX on behalf of its clients including CBL, Airtel, Arienti and Bitopi (Bangladesh) were also shortlisted for the final round. This placed\n\nRoar AdX amongst Meta managed partners with the highest number of shortlisted submissions at the event.\n\nThese recognitions underscore Roar AdX\u2019s role in enabling local brands to compete against regional leaders by aligning creative, execution, and performance measurement with global platform standards. Roar AdX\u2019s team of Meta Blueprint experts work closely with Meta teams across Asia Pacific, applying best practices, platform insights, and creative guidance to ensure Sri Lankan campaigns stand up to regional standards."
  },
