    "description": "History repeats itself \u2013 Ukraine is Putin\u2019s Czechoslovakia",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/history-repeats-itself-ukraine-is-putins-czechoslovakia/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
