    "chunk_text": "The success of any disaster prevention or disaster impact mitigation strategy hinges on the effective law enforcement and the implementation of policies in place to prevent disasters, manage their impacts, save lives, and look after victims and help them rebuild their lives.\n\nDr. Amarasinghe has said nature has delivered a dire warning, and if Sri Lanka fails to respond with decisive action, the next disaster will not be an accident \u2014 it will be a consequence. One cannot but agree with him. All politicians, policymakers, community leaders, the business community, and the general public must heed his prescient warning and act accordingly.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
