    "description": "Devastating  Impact of \u201cCyclone Ditwah\u201d on Sri Lanka : At least 334 dead and 370 missing, Over Eleven  Lakhs of people affected with Nearly Two Lakhs Displaced  Accommodated in State run Safety Centres",
