    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s vanishing snakes: Scientists warn policy paralysis is driving a silent crisis",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/sri-lankas-vanishing-snakes-scientists-warn-policy-paralysis-is-driving-a-silent-crisis/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
    "time_ut": 1764506940.0,
