    "chunk_size_bytes": 1452,
    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka Insurance honoured at National Supply Chain Excellence Awards 2025\n\nSri Lanka Insurance (SLIC) has been honoured with a Commendation Award for \u2018Best Supply Chain Practicing Organization \u2013 Service Category\u2019 at the National Supply Chain Excellence Awards 2025.\n\nThe prestigious award, organized by the Institute of Supply and Materials Management (ISMM), recognises SLIC\u2019s exemplary performance in procurement management. The company was selected from 24 nominated organisations for its strong governance, transparency, and adherence to national procurement guidelines.\n\nChairman Nusith Kumaratunga commented, \u201cThis recognition underscores our commitment to the highest standards of integrity and efficiency. We continue to strengthen our procurement processes through accountability and digitisation, ensuring public trust remains at the heart of what we do.\u201d\n\nAs the nation\u2019s largest insurer, SLIC has embedded procurement excellence into its corporate strategy, modernising processes with digital tools to promote value creation and sustainability. This commendation reinforces SLIC\u2019s standing as a benchmark for responsible corporate governance in Sri Lanka.\n\nA national health wake-up call: Why wellness is the future of insurance\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
