    "md5": "eaeb0d6ba4d86511c94f94bf48d2515b",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1195,
    "chunk_text": "KT Clean Star unveils advanced Nano Coating Solutions in Sri Lanka\n\nKT Clean Star, a member of the KT Group, has launched two advanced Japanese nanotechnology products in Sri Lanka:\u00a0Nano Shine\u00a0and\u00a0Nano Maintenance.\n\nDeveloped by Japan\u2019s System Brain Corporation and established in over 40 countries, these solutions set new benchmarks for surface protection.\u00a0Nano Shine\u00a0provides vehicles with a long-lasting, high-gloss, and scratch-resistant shield that repels water and simplifies cleaning.\u00a0Nano Maintenance\u00a0offers durable protection for building exteriors and interiors, ensuring surfaces remain resilient against environmental wear.\n\nBacked by extensive research and testing, these eco-conscious products bring world-class innovation to Sri Lanka\u2019s automotive and property sectors, promising unmatched durability, shine, and ease of maintenance.\n\nA national health wake-up call: Why wellness is the future of insurance\n\nDr. Ilma Osman Sedar honoured with prestigious mental health awards\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
