    "md5": "594d30eaae081f5c2ead8afe88583610",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1441,
    "chunk_text": "EKHO Ella ranked in top 1% of hotels worldwide on TripAdvisor\n\nEKHO Ella, a boutique hotel in Sri Lanka\u2019s hill country, has been honored with the prestigious TripAdvisor Travellers\u2019 Choice Best of the Best Award for 2025. This accolade places it among the top one percent of hotels globally, based on consistently outstanding guest reviews.\n\nThe award recognizes the hotel\u2019s unique railway-inspired concept, warm hospitality, and its commitment to blending local heritage with modern comfort. To celebrate this achievement, EKHO Ella held an Employee Felicitation Ceremony, honoring the dedicated team whose service is central to its success.\n\n\u201cThis recognition shows that guests value our blend of cultural storytelling and refined service. Our railway-themed concept pays tribute to Sri Lanka\u2019s hill country train journey, creating a truly distinctive experience.\u201d said Adrian Jansz, Vice President of Sales and Marketing for CHC Hotels.\u201d\n\nPerched above the iconic Ella Gap, the property offers easy access to major landmarks. This award highlights a growing traveler preference for smaller hotels that offer character, cultural depth, and a strong sense of place.\n\nKT Clean Star unveils advanced Nano Coating Solutions in Sri Lanka\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
