    "md5": "495de4f91bd8d40a0afd62cc3e7a8e39",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1436,
    "chunk_text": "Dr. Ilma Osman Sedar honoured with prestigious mental health awards\n\nDr. S. F. Ilma Osman Sedar has been distinguished with a series of national and international awards in 2025, recognizing her exceptional contributions to mental health care in Sri Lanka.\n\nHer accolades include the\u00a0Excellence in Psychology & Counseling \u2013 Legendary Woman of the Year\u00a0at the Women Legends Awards, the\u00a0Outstanding Psychological Advisor Award\u00a0at the Iconic Awards, and the\u00a0Excellence in Clinical Psychology\u00a0award at the Lakwanitha Abhimani Awards. These honors reflect her transformative work in psychological well-being, mental health education, and community rehabilitation. This follows her 2024\u00a0Honorary Doctorate in Psychology\u00a0from Washington Digital University, USA.\n\nAn accomplished researcher and founder of the Hope Wellness Center in Wattala, Dr. Sedar is a member of the Global Institute of Counseling Professionals (GIOCP) and a graduate member of the Lanka Association of Psychologists & Counselling Professionals (LAPCP). Her awards collectively celebrate her patient-centred care, influential advisory role, and dedication to empowering women in healthcare leadership.\n\nKT Clean Star unveils advanced Nano Coating Solutions in Sri Lanka\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
