    "chunk_size_bytes": 1157,
    "chunk_text": "SriLankan Airlines issues urgent advisory for flight crew\n\nIn light of the current situation in the country and its impact on standard communication networks, SriLankan Airlines has released a special advisory for its pilots and cabin crew.\n\nThe airline has identified difficulties in contacting certain crew members through regular channels. To ensure the continued smooth operation of its flight schedule, the management urgently requests all pilots and cabin crew members to make immediate contact.\n\nCrew members are instructed to get in touch with the Airline\u2019s Crew Control Centre (CCC) without delay for essential updates and further instructions.\n\nThe airline emphasizes that a prompt response from all crew is crucial for maintaining operational readiness and the continuity of its vital services.\n\nDr. Ilma Osman Sedar honoured with prestigious mental health awards\n\nBally\u2019s Colombo marks 30 years, solidifies reputation as a \u2018vibrant leisure hub\u2019\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
