    "description": "Cyclone Ditwa: A storm Sri Lanka saw coming but tourism still paid the price",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Cyclone-Ditwa-A-storm-Sri-Lanka-saw-coming-but-tourism-still-paid-the-price/4-785025",
    "lang": "en",
