    "md5": "7d2106b59a57f267b4ddd228e9ca0042",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 556,
    "chunk_text": "UN extends solidarity to Sri Lanka amid Ditwah weather crisis\n\nUnited Nations Resident Representative Marc-Andr\u00e9 Franche yesterday expressed their deepest solidarity with Sri Lanka in the wake of the Ditwah cyclone.\n\n\u201cDeeply saddened by the loss of lives caused by #CycloneDitwah,\u201d he posted via \u2018X\u2019 yesterday.\n\nHe noted that the UN Sri Lanka is mobilising its teams across the UN system to support national rescue and early recovery efforts, in coordination with authorities.\n\n\u201cWe stand in solidarity with all affected communities,\u201d he added."
