    "chunk_text": "Good procurement, sustainable supply chains, and smart logistics will uplift engineering practice moving Sri Lankan engineering away from brute force earth modification toward precision based, eco aligned, digitally guided, and resilience focused construction.\n\n*Firaz Cassim (MCIPS, MRICS, FCIOB, CMILT, MCIArb, FCMI) is a multi-chartered procurement, construction, and commercial specialist with over 19 years of leadership experience across major infrastructure and engineering projects in Qatar, UAE, Saudi Arabia, and Sri Lanka."
