    "description": "Cyclone Ditwah  Devastation : Death Toll Rises to  390 ; Over 15,000 Houses Destroyed.  More than 200 Roads  Remain Inaccessible; Bridges, Sections of Railway  Tracks and Power Lines Damaged. Many Countries Pledge Support to Sri Lanka for Recovery Measures.",
