    "chunk_text": "Local music lovers will get the opportunity of seeing their favourite band in action again, towards mid-January, after they complete their assignment in the Seychelles.\n\nBack home, they will move into action at their usual venues, in Colombo: Gatz, at Cinnamon Life, and Mamas Beach, in Hikkaduwa.\n\nAlthough the outfit did undergo a few lineup changes, with Donald Pieris at the helm, they are now oozing with professionalism where their music is concerned, their presentation \u2026 and their attire, as well.\n\nDonald is not only a great drummer but also excels as a vocalist.\n\nIn fact, he is widely regarded as one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most iconic vocalists, and, with Mirage, he has for company Sudham (bass/vocals), Gayan (lead guitar/vocals), Danu (female vocalist) and Toosha (keyboards).\n\nThe folly of imported ignorance: Why Sri Lanka must reject the foreign anti-vaccine delusion\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
