    "description": "The folly of imported ignorance: Why Sri Lanka must reject the foreign anti-vaccine delusion",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/the-folly-of-imported-ignorance-why-sri-lanka-must-reject-the-foreign-anti-vaccine-delusion/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
