    "date_str": "2025-12-02",
    "description": "Cyclone Ditwah: Testing NPP Govt.\u2019s competence and public confidence",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Cyclone-Ditwah-Testing-NPP-Govt-s-competence-and-public-confidence/4-785085",
