    "description": "After Cyclone Ditwah: Climate-proofing Sri Lanka\u2019s health system",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/after-cyclone-ditwah-climate-proofing-sri-lankas-health-system/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
