    "num": "dbsjeyarajcom-a76f2ec3",
    "date_str": "2025-12-03",
    "description": "JVP General -Secretary Tilvin Silva\u2019s  Negative and Positive \u201cEncounters\u201d with Two  Different Tamil Diaspora  Groups in London.",
