    "description": "Nepal extends $ 200,000 as relief assistance in Sri Lanka in solidarity",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Nepal-extends-200-000-as-relief-assistance-in-Sri-Lanka-in-solidarity/56-785145",
    "lang": "en",
