    "md5": "02e5e60e76abc4242da10056a5a03ee6",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1920,
    "chunk_text": "\u2018ICC Timber Deck Tiles: A perfect blend of natural charm, strength, and sophistication\u2019\n\nTransform your living spaces with the natural warmth, durability, and elegance of ICC Timber Deck Tiles, a premium innovation from International Construction Consortium (Pvt) Ltd (ICC), a leader in Sri Lanka\u2019s construction industry for over four decades. Renowned for its commitment to craftsmanship, innovation, and environmental responsibility, ICC combines aesthetic sophistication and practical performance through these eco-conscious tiles, designed to add beauty, comfort, and lasting value to a wide range of outdoor and semi-outdoor spaces.\n\nWhether it\u2019s a pool deck, walkway, patio, balcony, or roof terrace, ICC Timber Deck Tiles provide a stylish and enduring solution that enhances any environment. Designed to infuse your surroundings with the timeless elegance of natural wood, they feature rich, warm tones and authentic textures that complement both traditional and modern architecture.\n\nCrafted from high-quality, eco-conscious materials, ICC Timber Deck Tiles showcase the natural beauty of timber while providing exceptional strength and durability. Engineered to withstand sun, rain, and heavy foot traffic, they maintain their rich, earthy tones with minimal maintenance. Their warmth and texture complement styles from rustic to contemporary, offering lasting value for residential, commercial, and hospitality spaces.\n\nOne of the standout features of ICC Timber Deck Tiles is their versatility. Around pools, they offer slip resistance and refined appeal. On walkways, they provide a stable, elegant surface that blends naturally with garden landscapes. For patios and balconies, they create cozy, inviting extensions of living space that are ideal for relaxation or entertaining guests. On roof terraces, their strength and style make them a resilient and elegant choice for elevated outdoor living."
  },
