    "chunk_text": "Harfouch claimed, on Instagram, that he had already told HBO America (an American premium television network)\u2014a full 24 hours before the final\u2014that Mexico would win. He said this was because Ra\u00fal Rocha, the owner of the Miss Universe Organisation, had business ties with F\u00e1tima\u2019s father.\n\nHe further alleged that Rocha, and his son, contacted him in Dubai to personally ask for his vote, telling him directly that \u201cit will be good for our business.\u201d\n\nIn the meanwhile, supporters of F\u00e1tima Bosch say her coronation was no coincidence, with one fan adding: \u201cF\u00e1tima stood out because she is different; she combines beauty with intelligence, strength, and a determination that few possess. She is a woman who cannot be intimidated by anyone, regardless of their power, status, or wealth. She firmly defends her ideas and does so with authenticity, without losing her essence.\u2019\u2019\n\nThe fan went on to say that F\u00e1tima has something that goes beyond appearances: the ability to inspire.\n\n\u201cShe will be the voice of many women and girls around the world, reminding them to speak up, fight for what they believe in, and never settle. And that should make you proud as well, because her courage and strength represent all of us.\u201d\n\nAnother fan mentioned that F\u00e1tima doesn\u2019t just shine for herself, she shines for those who look at her and find in her an example of courage and dignity, adding that she was a winner from the time she defended herself from the humiliation of Nawat.\n\n\u201cIn that situation, natural leadership surfaced in her; an epitome of a peaceful fighter. That\u2019s how she won the hearts of many. Her winning is not measured by how highfaluting her English language is. Let\u2019s face this truth \u2013 a case of good karma!\u2019\u2019\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, em