    "md5": "37d1e1ea6e6c669e3d609c6ce818663a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1958,
    "chunk_text": "Combinations to slow down skin ageing\n\nLast week I did mention that I would work out some combinations to help you slow down skin ageing.\n\nYou will need the white of 01egg, 01 teaspoon lemon juice and 01 teaspoon honey.\n\nWhisk the egg white with the lemon juice and honey until frothy, and then apply the mixture evenly to your cleansed face. Leave it for 15-20 minutes before rinsing with lukewarm water.\n\nAfter rinsing, follow up with a moisturiser to lock in hydration and support enhanced elasticity.\n\nUse it 02-03 times a week for optimal tightening and oil control.\n\n(Egg whites are a popular natural remedy for anti-ageing as they help tighten and tone the skin. Their high protein content works to shrink pores and control excess oil, leading to reduced fine lines and a firmer texture.)\n\nYou will need 01 ripe banana, 01 tablespoon honey and 01 teaspoon lemon juice.\n\nMash the banana until smooth and mix in the honey and lemon juice. Apply the paste evenly on your face and leave it for 15-20 minutes and then rinse with lukewarm water.\n\nApply it 02-03 times a week to maintain hydration and promote a youthful glow.\n\n(Bananas are rich in vitamins and antioxidants that deeply moisturise the skin, boost elasticity, and help minimise wrinkles. This mask acts as an excellent at-home anti-ageing treatment for rejuvenating tired skin.)\n\nYou will need 01 ripe avocado, 01 tablespoon honey and 01 tablespoon yoghurt\n\nMash the avocado until smooth, then mix in the honey and yoghurt and apply the paste to your face and let it sit for 15-20 minutes before rinsing off with lukewarm water.\n\nUse 02-03 times a week to consistently replenish moisture and nutrients.\n\n(Avocado is a nutrient powerhouse, offering healthy fats, vitamins, and antioxidants. It deeply nourishes, hydrates, and improves skin elasticity, making it a standout natural remedy for anti-ageing.)\n\nYou will need 01teaspoon turmeric powder, 01 teaspoon honey and 01 tablespoon yoghurt."
