    "chunk_text": "Avon Pharmo Chem donates Rs. 2 m for flood relief\n\nIn support of the Government\u2019s program to provide relief to those affected by the adverse weather conditions, Avon Pharmo Chem Ltd. Managing Director Kumara Ekanayake, and Australian Immigration lawyer Hemanta Punchihewa donated Rs. 2 million to aid relief efforts. The relevant cheques were officially handed over by the donors to the Secretary to the President Dr. Nandika Sanath Kumanayake."
