    "md5": "a09e7db1eaf51f64375e86f95cc9624f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 405,
    "chunk_text": "Rs. 20 m donated to Rebuilding Sri Lanka\n\nDaily contributions continue to flow into the Government\u2019s \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 Fund, established to provide relief to communities affected by Cyclone Ditwah.\n\nYesterday, the Sri Lanka Administrative Service Association and Pragathi Lanka International Ltd., made financial donations amounting to Rs. 10 million each to support the ongoing relief efforts."
