    "description": "US ICE arrests Lankan with alleged history of sex crimes working as college professor",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/US-ICE-arrests-Lankan-with-alleged-history-of-sex-crimes-working-as-college-professor/34-785205",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
