    "chunk_size_bytes": 1753,
    "chunk_text": "Dialog Enterprise Principal Sponsor of Sri Lanka CERT National Cyber Security Conference 2025\n\nDialog Enterprise, the corporate solutions arm of Dialog Axiata PLC and the leading ICT solutions provider in Sri Lanka, proudly served as the Principal Sponsor of the Sri Lanka CERT|CC Cyber Security Conference 2025, the nation\u2019s premier platform dedicated to strengthening cybersecurity awareness and resilience across enterprises and communities. The annual conference brought together policymakers, industry leaders, and technology experts to advance the national dialogue on cyber resilience and foster collaboration towards a safer digital future.\n\nAt Dialog Enterprise, the belief that technology should empower progress while safeguarding people, businesses, and national infrastructure remains at the core of its purpose. As the trusted digital partner for organisations across Sri Lanka, Dialog Enterprise continues to enable transformation through end-to-end, secure, and future-ready ICT solutions that help enterprises innovate confidently in a rapidly evolving digital landscape. The company\u2019s comprehensive portfolio across connectivity, cloud, cybersecurity, and managed services empowers enterprises to strengthen their digital foundations while maintaining operational integrity and trust.\n\nCybersecurity continues to be a vital aspect of this commitment as digital adoption accelerates across government, corporate, and SME sectors. With the growing need to protect data, operations, and customer trust, Dialog Enterprise\u2019s continued partnership with Sri Lanka CERT|CC reflects a shared mission to enhance the nation\u2019s cybersecurity readiness and build a culture of awareness, resilience, and preparedness against emerging threats."
  },
