    "chunk_size_bytes": 423,
    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka Overseas Chinese Association donates to cyclone relief\n\nDemonstrating their support for Sri Lanka\u2019s post-disaster recovery efforts, the Sri Lanka Overseas Chinese Association has donated Rs. 1 million to assist in the nation\u2019s rebuilding process, the President\u2019s Media Division announced.\n\nThe cheque was officially handed over Presidential Secretariat Director General of Public Relations Dharmasiri Gamge."
