    "description": "South Korea provides emergency relief to Sri Lanka following Cyclone Ditwah",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/South-Korea-provides-emergency-relief-to-Sri-Lanka-following-Cyclone-Ditwah/56-785301",
