    "chunk_text": "UK increases SL relief funding to \u00a3 1 m\n\nThe British High Commission yesterday announced that with UK aid already reaching Sri Lanka\u2019s hardest-hit communities with life-saving support and early recovery, it was providing additional funding support, taking the total up to \u00a3 1 million ($ 1.32 million).\n\nThe UK Government earlier this week provided financial support amounting to \u00a3 675,000 ($ 890,000)."
