    "description": "JXG\u2019s Holistic Leadership Summit 2025 champions blueprint for corporate steadiness and human-centred growth",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/JXG-s-Holistic-Leadership-Summit-2025-champions-blueprint-for-corporate-steadiness-and-human-centred-growth/34-785307",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1764963503.0,
    "chunk_id": "2025-12-06-dailyftlk-49923cd4-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "28c29c7f00d3c527938da49d0aafd6c8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1759,
    "chunk_text": "JXG\u2019s Holistic Leadership Summit 2025 champions blueprint for corporate steadiness and human-centred growth\n\nThe panel discussion \u2018The Future of Leadership is Holistic \u2013 Are We Ready?\u2019 featured JXG\u2019s leadership members and was moderated by Dona Amelia\n\nIn a world increasingly defined by volatility and rapid change, JXG (Janashakthi Group) recognises leadership as a shared journey of growth, authenticity, and collective purpose.\n\nIn steering a bold new course for leadership, one prioritising psychological strength, authentic purpose, and human connection as the foundation for enduring success, JXG pioneered a proactive blueprint for corporate stability.\n\nThe JXG Holistic Leadership Summit 2025 which unfolded recently was designed to future-proof the business, creating a replicable model for how companies can retain top talent and drive sustainable growth in uncertain times. The unconventional leadership event was a curated journey of introspection, dialogue, and renewal, helping leaders align personal well-being with professional impact.\n\nThe inspiring convergence united senior leaders from the Group with two internationally acclaimed facilitators; Nick Jonsson, a renowned speaker and author, widely recognised for his advocacy of mental health in executive leadership, and complementing his insights was Dona Amelia, a Southeast Asian entrepreneur and empowerment coach celebrated for her transformative journey and leadership impact.\n\nIn the summit, participants explored five core dimensions of holistic leadership: surrender, purpose, connection, goals, and discipline. These themes encouraged leaders to reflect deeply on what it means to lead with intention, empathy, and steadiness in today\u2019s complex business environment."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2025-12-06-dailyftlk-49923cd4",
    "num": "dailyftlk-49923cd4",
    "date_str": "2025-12-06",
    "description": "JXG\u2019s Holistic Leadership Summit 2025 champions blueprint for corporate steadiness and human-centred growth",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/JXG-s-Holistic-Leadership-Summit-2025-champions-blueprint-for-corporate-steadiness-and-human-centred-growth/34-785307",
    "lang": "en",
